SUMMARY:AIRSWIFT GLOBAL AS — Investor Call
DESCRIPTION:Reach out to your dealer to confirm timing and availability\n\n
 Issuer: AIRSWIFT GLOBAL AS\n\nDeal context:\nAirswift Global AS is pursuin
 g a USD 300 million senior secured bond offering with a 5-year tenor\, hav
 ing mandated Pareto Securities as Sole Global Coordinator and Joint Bookru
 nner and Arctic Securities as Joint Bookrunner. Net proceeds are intended 
 to refinance existing debt (including existing bonds with ISIN NO001315238
 9) and finance general corporate purposes including acquisitions. The deal
  is at the mandate stage with investor calls scheduled for October 5 and 6
 \, and management available for 1-on-1 meetings from October 2.
